* support an Organization's internal operations, research, products, services,
  or proof of concept;
* produce revenue, compensation, or direct or indirect commercial advantage;
  or
* be incorporated into a product, service, managed service, or software-as-a-
  service offering.

"Enterprise Use" means any use that is not Personal Use. It includes, without
limitation, installation, execution, access, copying, modification,
distribution, hosting, evaluation, or operation by or for an Organization,
including internal testing and proof-of-concept use.

